\PYG{c+c1}{\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{} STEP 2.5: VALIDATE VOTE VALUES}
\PYG{c+c1}{\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{} Controlla in modo efficiente se qualche valore di tipo \PYGZsq{}slider\PYGZsq{} nel payload JSON}
\PYG{c+c1}{\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{} è al di fuori del suo range min/max definito o non è un numero valido.}
\PYG{k}{IF}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{k}{EXISTS}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{p}{(}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{c+c1}{\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{} Utilizza una Common Table Expression (CTE) per \PYGZdq{}spacchettare\PYGZdq{} il payload JSON}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{c+c1}{\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{} in una tabella temporanea di righe e colonne.}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{k}{WITH}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{n}{unpacked\PYGZus{}votes}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{k}{AS}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{p}{(}
\PYG{+w}{    }\PYG{k}{SELECT}
\PYG{+w}{      }\PYG{p}{(}\PYG{k}{value}\PYG{o}{\PYGZhy{}\PYGZgt{}\PYGZgt{}}\PYG{l+s+s1}{\PYGZsq{}voting\PYGZus{}form\PYGZus{}field\PYGZus{}id\PYGZsq{}}\PYG{p}{)}\PYG{o}{::}\PYG{n+nb}{uuid}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{k}{as}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{n}{field\PYGZus{}id}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{      }\PYG{p}{(}\PYG{k}{value}\PYG{o}{\PYGZhy{}\PYGZgt{}\PYGZgt{}}\PYG{l+s+s1}{\PYGZsq{}value\PYGZsq{}}\PYG{p}{)}\PYG{o}{::}\PYG{n+nb}{text}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{k}{as}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{k}{value}
\PYG{+w}{    }\PYG{k}{FROM}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{n}{jsonb\PYGZus{}array\PYGZus{}elements}\PYG{p}{(}\PYG{n}{p\PYGZus{}votes\PYGZus{}payload}\PYG{p}{)}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{p}{)}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{c+c1}{\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{} Seleziona le righe che violano le regole di validazione.}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{k}{SELECT}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{l+m+mf}{1}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{k}{FROM}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{n}{unpacked\PYGZus{}votes}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{n}{uv}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{c+c1}{\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{} Unisce i voti spacchettati con la tabella dei campi del form}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{c+c1}{\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{} per ottenere i metadati di ogni campo (tipo, min, max).}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{k}{JOIN}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{n}{public}\PYG{l+m+mf}{.}\PYG{n}{voting\PYGZus{}form\PYGZus{}fields}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{n}{vff}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{k}{ON}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{n}{vff}\PYG{l+m+mf}{.}\PYG{n}{id}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{o}{=}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{n}{uv}\PYG{l+m+mf}{.}\PYG{n}{field\PYGZus{}id}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{k}{WHERE}
\PYG{+w}{    }\PYG{c+c1}{\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{} Applica il controllo solo ai campi di tipo \PYGZsq{}slider\PYGZsq{}.}
\PYG{+w}{    }\PYG{n}{vff}\PYG{l+m+mf}{.}\PYG{k}{type}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{o}{=}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{l+s+s1}{\PYGZsq{}slider\PYGZsq{}}
\PYG{+w}{    }\PYG{k}{AND}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{p}{(}
\PYG{+w}{      }\PYG{c+c1}{\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{} Condizione 1: Il valore non è una stringa di un numero intero.}
\PYG{+w}{      }\PYG{k}{NOT}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{p}{(}\PYG{n}{uv}\PYG{l+m+mf}{.}\PYG{k}{value}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{o}{\PYGZti{}}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{l+s+s1}{\PYGZsq{}\PYGZca{}\PYGZhy{}?\PYGZbs{}d+\PYGZdl{}\PYGZsq{}}\PYG{p}{)}
\PYG{+w}{      }\PYG{c+c1}{\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{} Condizione 2: Oppure, se è un intero, è fuori dai limiti.}
\PYG{+w}{      }\PYG{k}{OR}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{n}{uv}\PYG{l+m+mf}{.}\PYG{k}{value}\PYG{o}{::}\PYG{n+nb}{integer}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{o}{\PYGZlt{}}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{n}{vff}\PYG{l+m+mf}{.}\PYG{n}{slider\PYGZus{}min\PYGZus{}value}
\PYG{+w}{      }\PYG{k}{OR}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{n}{uv}\PYG{l+m+mf}{.}\PYG{k}{value}\PYG{o}{::}\PYG{n+nb}{integer}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{o}{\PYGZgt{}}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{n}{vff}\PYG{l+m+mf}{.}\PYG{n}{slider\PYGZus{}max\PYGZus{}value}
\PYG{+w}{    }\PYG{p}{)}
\PYG{p}{)}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{k}{THEN}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{c+c1}{\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{} Se anche solo una riga viola le condizioni, solleva un\PYGZsq{}eccezione}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{c+c1}{\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{} e interrompe la transazione, impedendo l\PYGZsq{}inserimento dei dati.}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{n}{RAISE}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{n}{EXCEPTION}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{l+s+s1}{\PYGZsq{}Invalid vote value: A slider value is outside its allowed range or is not a valid number.\PYGZsq{}}\PYG{p}{;}
\PYG{k}{END}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{k}{IF}\PYG{p}{;}

